WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.635
-The former top prosecutor

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.871
for the Capital riots
said on Sunday

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.873
that the evidence in the attack
could support sedition charges,

00:00:07.873 --> 00:00:10.076
as federal investigators
continue to examine

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.744
former President Donald Trump's
role

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.412
in fomenting the insurrection.

00:00:13.412 --> 00:00:15.348
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:19.418
♪♪

00:00:19.418 --> 00:00:21.621
When you're a former occupant
of the Oval Office,

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.955
there are a few
different directions

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:24.590
you could go
with your post-presidency.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.092
There's the Jimmy Carter route,
of charitable work;

00:00:27.092 --> 00:00:29.662
the Bush route,
of painting portraits of dogs

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:32.431
like a weatherman filling in
at the last minute for Bob Ross.

00:00:32.431 --> 00:00:33.633
Then, there's the Obama route,

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.534
of making movies for Netflix,

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.303
kitesurfing
with Richard Branson,

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:39.271
dressing like an Italian
fashion designer,

00:00:39.271 --> 00:00:42.008
and making up excuses
to hang out with celebrities.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:44.477
[ As Obama ]
Here's an idea for a podcast.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:46.912
Me and, uh, Bruce Springsteen

00:00:46.912 --> 00:00:49.315
just kind of, uh...hanging out.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:50.383
"Mr. President,
that sounds great.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.384
What would it be about?"

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.319
It's called "Renegades."

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.022
I came up with the name myself.

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:57.423
"It's great!
What's it about?"

00:00:57.423 --> 00:00:59.192
Sometimes!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:00.360
Little Steven will be there,

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.096
but he has to share
a mic with, uh, Bruce.

00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.096
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.096 --> 00:01:05.130
Former President Donald Trump,

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:06.899
as is his wont,

00:01:06.899 --> 00:01:09.602
chose and charted
his own course.

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.903
He's decided to spend his time

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.906
creepily shuffling
around his Palm Beach resort,

00:01:13.906 --> 00:01:16.008
like the ghost
of a retired dentist

00:01:16.008 --> 00:01:17.577
who drowned in a water hazard

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.011
on the 18th hole.

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:20.913
[ Changes accent ]
I was looking for my ball

00:01:20.913 --> 00:01:23.549
[ Laughter ]
and I forgot to come up for air!

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:25.017
It was a Titleist.

00:01:25.017 --> 00:01:26.552
They're not cheap!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.020
Every weekend,
a new photo emerges

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.923
of Trump in the same getup --
red hat, white Polo,

00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:33.826
slacks that seem to be rising
faster than the sea level.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:37.130
He spent all that time
hanging out with pillow man

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.232
when he really should've
befriended the UNTUCKit guy.

00:01:39.232 --> 00:01:41.568
See how much more
comfortable he looks?

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:43.269
But, no, Trump would rather

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.571
wander around his own resort
like a lost grandpa

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:47.840
who's supposed to be
watching the kids at the mall.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:50.343
"We do have reports of a couple
of kids playing Keep Away

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.012
with a glow-in-the-dark dildo
at Spencer gifts.

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:54.580
Does that sound
like your grandkids?"

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:56.850
[ As Trump ]
That does sound like them, yes.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.984
His business and finances
are apparently

00:01:58.984 --> 00:02:00.019
in even worse shape.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:02.488
His net worth fell
by $700 million

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:03.522
during his presidency,

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:05.191
the Manhattan D.A.'s
investigation

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:07.994
of his business and tax returns
is intensifying,

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:10.763
and his Mar-a-Lago resort
just partially closed,

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:13.800
so they could use it
as a pop-up vaccination center.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:14.900
Wait, no, I read that wrong.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.636
It closed due
to a COVID outbreak.

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:17.936
[ Laughter ]
My God!

00:02:17.936 --> 00:02:19.806
COVID follows this guy

00:02:19.806 --> 00:02:22.609
like a rain cloud
following Daffy Duck.

00:02:22.609 --> 00:02:25.277
His rallies, the White House;
now, Mar-a-Lago.

00:02:25.277 --> 00:02:26.879
He's like a walking COVID test.

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.080
If you're ever, you know,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:30.015
in physical proximity
to Donald Trump,

00:02:30.015 --> 00:02:31.251
you should just, you know,

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.552
quarantine for like two weeks,
just to be safe.

00:02:33.552 --> 00:02:35.989
It really does perfectly capture
the state of the modern GOP

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.556
that their standard bearer,

00:02:37.556 --> 00:02:39.758 line:0%
the guy they tried
to overthrow democracy for,

00:02:39.758 --> 00:02:42.161 line:0%
is now a financially broke
and ghost criminal.

00:02:42.161 --> 00:02:44.096
At this point, I have to assume
he's also being investigated

00:02:44.096 --> 00:02:45.498
by Mulder and Scully.

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.000
[ As Scully ]
Mulder, look at this
COVID cluster.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.567
What could be causing this?"

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:49.602
[ As Mulder ]
Have you ever heard of the

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.637
coughing swamp ghost
of Palm Beach?

00:02:51.637 --> 00:02:53.505
Five or six years ago,
we used to make jokes

00:02:53.505 --> 00:02:55.574
about his skin tone and, now,
he doesn't even have one.

00:02:55.574 --> 00:02:57.176
He's the color of spackle.

00:02:57.176 --> 00:02:58.644
I guess it makes sense.
He's a landlord

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:01.013
because he looks like the layer
of paint you'd find

00:03:01.013 --> 00:03:03.582
after peeling back the wallpaper
in a Manhattan apartment.

00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:04.817
And, on top of everything else,

00:03:04.817 --> 00:03:07.753
even his iconic plane,
the private jet he used

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:10.023
to fly everywhere
during his first campaign,

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:12.125
has now apparently fallen
into such disrepair

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:13.993
that it's not
even flyable anymore.

00:03:13.993 --> 00:03:16.028
-The glory days
of the gold-plated jet

00:03:16.028 --> 00:03:18.330 line:0%
that Donald Trump once used
as his calling card

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.365 line:0%
seem far away.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:21.601 line:0%
It is now grounded
and in disrepair.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:23.869 line:0%
-It was the ultimate
status symbol --

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:26.272 line:0%
Donald Trump's Boeing 757.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:29.342 line:0%
A regular presence
on the 2016 campaign,

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:32.211 line:0%
at his marquee events,
there was his plane.

00:03:32.211 --> 00:03:35.081 line:0%
Today, however, the massive jet
sits abandoned

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:38.951 line:0%
at an upstate New York airport,
one engine mostly missing;

00:03:38.951 --> 00:03:42.522 line:0%
one wrapped, idle,
in apparent disrepair.

00:03:42.522 --> 00:03:45.691 line:0%
According to records,
it hasn't been flown in months.

00:03:45.691 --> 00:03:49.128 line:0%
-It's been sitting on the ramp
for at least a year or two

00:03:49.128 --> 00:03:53.032 line:0%
and the left engine's been
taken off, probably for service.

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:56.903 line:0%
-The crown jewel of Trump's
fleet, now, future unknown.

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:59.939
-Wow, who broke this story,
The Daily Metaphor?

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:01.307
He's finally coming face-to-face

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:02.808
with the consequences
of his actions.

00:04:02.808 --> 00:04:05.110
Trump's like a character
from an ancient Greek myth

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:08.480
who doesn't let Hades
finish describing the deal.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.882
"You will be blessed
with all the riches

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:11.184
in the world, but, in return --"

00:04:11.184 --> 00:04:12.485
[ As Trump ] Deal!

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:14.353
"Don't you want to hear
the rest of the trade?"

00:04:14.353 --> 00:04:16.555
I'm good.
Just get me on that Pegasus.

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:18.057
"It's just, technically,

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:20.460
I have to explain
the terms of the deal."

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.760
That's what my lawyer's for.

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.095
Where is he, by the way?

00:04:23.095 --> 00:04:24.897
I told him to meet me
at the River Styx.

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:25.898
[ As Giuliani ]
River Styx?!

00:04:25.898 --> 00:04:27.333
I went to Styx concert!

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:29.469
[ Laughter ]
Oh, Rudy!

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:31.637 line:0%
And not only are Trump's
finances, his resort,

00:04:31.637 --> 00:04:33.673 line:0%
his business, and his plane
all in shambles,

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:35.841 line:0%
but he's now also reportedly

00:04:35.841 --> 00:04:38.711
under multiple investigations,
including an investigation

00:04:38.711 --> 00:04:41.247
of the riot at the Capitol
on January 6th.

00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:42.748
The federal prosecutor
who previously

00:04:42.748 --> 00:04:44.917
led the investigation
of the riot

00:04:44.917 --> 00:04:46.351
told "60 Minutes" on Sunday

00:04:46.351 --> 00:04:49.822
there's likely enough evidence
to meet sedition charges.

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:52.091
-I personally believe
the evidence

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:53.459
is trending towards that

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:55.961
and probably meets
those elements.

00:04:55.961 --> 00:04:58.464
-Do you anticipate
sedition charges

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:00.165
against some of these suspects?

00:05:00.165 --> 00:05:06.839
-I believe the facts
do support those charges

00:05:06.839 --> 00:05:09.241
and I think that,
as we go forward,

00:05:09.241 --> 00:05:11.010
more facts will support that.

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.644
-I have to say,
I'm not sure why we have

00:05:12.644 --> 00:05:14.814
to have federal prosecutors
on "60 Minutes,"

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.215
telling us something
we already know.

00:05:16.215 --> 00:05:18.551
Either charge them
with sedition, or don't.

00:05:18.551 --> 00:05:20.820
When did criminal investigators
start doing press junkets,

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.221
like movie tours?

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:24.390
"Obviously, there were
a lot of pranks on set.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.225
It was a fun investigation."

00:05:26.225 --> 00:05:28.527
I mean, I'm no lawyer and I
don't think sedition charges

00:05:28.527 --> 00:05:30.096
should be leveled lightly
or often,

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:32.265
but if a violent attack
on the Capitol

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:34.500
to impede the lawful counting
of electoral votes

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.834
isn't sedition, then what is?

00:05:35.834 --> 00:05:37.170
They stormed
the House and Senate,

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.671
injured 140 police officers.

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:40.773
I'm not saying
they were likely to succeed

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:42.274
in overthrowing
the U.S. government,

00:05:42.274 --> 00:05:43.943
but that doesn't mean
it's not sedition.

00:05:43.943 --> 00:05:46.345
You're still guilty
of attempted robbery,

00:05:46.345 --> 00:05:47.613
even if you get caught

00:05:47.613 --> 00:05:49.448
breaking into a museum
in the middle of the night

00:05:49.448 --> 00:05:51.483
because you forgot
to silence your ringtone.

00:05:51.483 --> 00:05:53.285
"I'm in.
I'm going to steal the diamond

00:05:53.285 --> 00:05:55.354
and then quietly rappel
down the south wall.

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:56.956
-♪ Po, po, po, po ♪
-Oh, no!

00:05:56.956 --> 00:05:59.158
-♪ PopoZao, PopoZao ♪
-It's my mom!

00:05:59.158 --> 00:06:01.894
Oh!
She loves K-Fed.

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:04.063
Hey, remember when Sal,
earlier today, said,

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:06.299
should we switch it to my dad,

00:06:06.299 --> 00:06:09.001
so I can say,
"It's my PapaZao"?

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:10.670
And we all like, "No, Sal.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.004
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.004 --> 00:06:15.174
That will tarnish
your reputation."

00:06:15.174 --> 00:06:16.242
We did him a huge solid.

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:19.545
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.545 --> 00:06:21.714
And, now, it's up to Sal --

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:23.783
"Am I'm going to leave that in
or am I going to cut around it?"

00:06:23.783 --> 00:06:27.953
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.953 --> 00:06:30.590
Looks like someone else's
integrity's on trial.

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:32.824
[ Laughter ]

00:06:32.824 --> 00:06:35.261
There's already extensive
evidence in the public record

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:37.263
of detailed planning
by militia members

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:39.031
in advance of the January 6 riot

00:06:39.031 --> 00:06:41.567
and proof they were coordinating
their movements

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.602
as it was happening
and, not only are prosecutors

00:06:43.602 --> 00:06:46.538
apparently considering sedition
charges for the rioters,

00:06:46.538 --> 00:06:48.941
they're also examining the role
Trump himself played

00:06:48.941 --> 00:06:50.843
in fomenting
those seditious acts.

00:06:50.843 --> 00:06:52.879
-Has the role of former
President Trump

00:06:52.879 --> 00:06:54.780
been part of your investigation?

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.683
-It's unequivocal that Trump
was the magnet

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:00.352
that brought the people
to D.C. on the 6th.

00:07:00.352 --> 00:07:03.122
Now, the question is,
is he criminally culpable

00:07:03.122 --> 00:07:05.458
for everything that happened
during the siege,

00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:06.858
during the breach?

00:07:06.858 --> 00:07:09.228
What I can tell you is this,
based upon, again,

00:07:09.228 --> 00:07:11.229
what we see in the public record

00:07:11.229 --> 00:07:13.665
and what we see
in public statements in court.

00:07:13.665 --> 00:07:15.101
We have plenty of people.

00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:18.204
We have soccer moms from Ohio
that were arrested, saying,

00:07:18.204 --> 00:07:20.539
"Well, I did this
because my president said

00:07:20.539 --> 00:07:23.508
I had to take back our House."

00:07:23.508 --> 00:07:25.344
That moves the needle
towards that direction.

00:07:25.344 --> 00:07:28.547
Maybe the president is culpable
for those actions.

00:07:28.547 --> 00:07:30.282
-In short,
you have investigators

00:07:30.282 --> 00:07:31.951
looking into
the president's role.

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:34.587
-We have people looking
at everything, correct.

00:07:34.587 --> 00:07:36.121
Everything's being looked at.

00:07:36.121 --> 00:07:37.590
-Wow.
He's being investigated

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.525
for fomenting
a violent sedition

00:07:39.525 --> 00:07:42.027
and he doesn't even have his jet
to flee the country.

00:07:42.027 --> 00:07:43.362
If he gets indicted,
he's going to have

00:07:43.362 --> 00:07:45.764
to book a commercial flight
under a false name

00:07:45.764 --> 00:07:46.965
and dye his hair.

00:07:46.965 --> 00:07:48.000
[ As Trump ]
So what do you do?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.868
Oh, insurance.
That's a great business.

00:07:49.868 --> 00:07:50.969
I was the president.

00:07:50.969 --> 00:07:52.504
Uh, uh, I mean,

00:07:52.504 --> 00:07:54.039
urrrrr,

00:07:54.039 --> 00:07:56.509
of my condo association.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:56.509 --> 00:07:58.911
[ Laughs ]
That was close.

00:07:58.911 --> 00:08:01.047
[ Laughter ]
So there were militia members

00:08:01.047 --> 00:08:03.148
who planned and coordinated
their attacks

00:08:03.148 --> 00:08:05.083 line:0%
and they were there
at Trump's explicit direction.

00:08:05.083 --> 00:08:07.152 line:0%
Remember,
he even advertised the date

00:08:07.152 --> 00:08:08.821 line:0%
ahead of time and said...

00:08:10.556 --> 00:08:12.425
He sowed a violent insurrection,

00:08:12.425 --> 00:08:14.660
like an old guy hanging
outside a liquor store,

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.295
inviting teenagers
to a house party.

00:08:16.295 --> 00:08:17.730
[ Changes accent ]
Be there.
It's going to be wild.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:19.765
We're going to hotbox
my '86 Camaro.

00:08:19.765 --> 00:08:21.433
Bring pizza!
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.433 --> 00:08:23.768
The previous president fomented
a violent insurrection

00:08:23.768 --> 00:08:24.903
to overthrow democracy

00:08:24.903 --> 00:08:26.471
and the vast majority
of his party

00:08:26.471 --> 00:08:27.873
either went along with him

00:08:27.873 --> 00:08:29.709
or stood by silently
and let it happen.

00:08:29.709 --> 00:08:31.344
There needs to be
consequences for that,

00:08:31.344 --> 00:08:33.512
especially since the GOP
is still trying

00:08:33.512 --> 00:08:36.182
to rig our democracy in their
favor through other means,

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:38.584
whether it's their ferocious
assault on voting rights

00:08:38.584 --> 00:08:40.119
or their attempts
to challenge anyone

00:08:40.119 --> 00:08:42.488
who wouldn't go along with their
attempt to steal the election.

00:08:42.488 --> 00:08:44.556
Trump left our democracy
in the same state

00:08:44.556 --> 00:08:45.558
he left his plane...

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:47.727 line:0%
-Grounded and in disrepair.

00:08:47.727 --> 00:08:49.061
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

